<title>BERMUDA: Norex Industries holders okay stock split.</title>
<headline>Norex Industries holders okay stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norex Industries Inc said Friday its shareholders had approved a four-for-one stock split at the annual meeting.</p>
<p>The split will be effective June 20, record June 10.</p>
</text>
